<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" name="viewport"> <title>table_attributes</title> </head> <body> <main> <h1 id="sec:tables">1 Table attribute combinations</h1> <p>Table <a href="#tbl:directional">1</a> selects one row and one column while leaving other cells unchanged.</p> <table data-alignment="left" data-autofit="content" data-cell-margin-bottom="2mm" data-cell-margin-right="4mm" data-cell_margin_left="3mm" data-cell_margin_top="1mm" data-revision-columns="3" data-revision_rows="2" data-row-height="0.6cm" id="tbl:directional"> <caption>Table 1 Directional margins and selective revisions.</caption> <thead> <tr> <th>Item</th> <th>Value</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Notes</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Baseline</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">10</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Original</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Candidate</td> <td>12</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Updated</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-custom-style="Para After Table"> <p>The paragraph after the table should retain its post-table style.</p> </div> <table data-autofit="window" data-revision-rows="*" id="tbl:all-rows"> <caption>Table 2 A newly added table with a revised caption.</caption> <thead> <tr> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Method</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Score</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Added method</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">15</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table data-autofit="window" data-custom-style="TableNoBorder" data-revision_columns="*" id="tbl:all-columns"> <caption>Table 3 Whole-table revision selected through columns.</caption> <thead> <tr> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Method</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Score</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Another method</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">16</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </main> </body> </html>
